14. Payments, refunds and chargebacks
Refunds (all refunds are in this section): the Agent Infrastructure Install fee is refunded in full, to your original payment method, only in these cases:
(a) Install guarantee: an Audit Item is still not set up after the cure period, under the Section 4 rules (paid within 10 business days);
(b) Cancel before we start: you email us before you give us any access, or before we start setting up, whichever is first (paid within 7 days);
(c) Stalled order closed under Section 2 (paid within 7 days);
(d) Declined order under Section 7 (paid within 7 days); or
(e) where the law requires it.
